[h1]Patch Notes - v1.0.3[/h1]

[h2]Fixes[/h2]
[list]
[*]Fixed a bug with Conductor Elixir and its skills when playing with Stoverick;
[*]Fixed a bug with Conductor Elixir's skill Arid Melody, as it was not working properly;
[*]Fixed an issue with the Starfishes as they were not being defeated properly, remaining in the field and dealing damage;
[*]Fixed some typos on skills;
[*]Fixed a bug with Jewellia's achievement, as it was not triggering for some people.
[list]
[*]If you don't get the achievement automatically, try entering an Area, the Character Selection Screen and exiting back to the Area Selection.
[/list][/list]

[h1]Patch Notes - v1.0.1[/h1]

[h2]Fixes[/h2]
[list]
[*]Fixed the navigation with Gamepad for the Kitchen and Laboratory as it wasn't working as intended;
[*]Fixed the description of Secret #58;
[*]Fixed the description for Wallie's Clothing Skill Percussive Maintenance at Level 1 as it was showing the wrong skill;
[*]Fixed an issue where all Great Maligmic type bosses were not giving the proper Quality for Newston's photos;
[*]Fixed a bug with Newston's Privileged Information Skill, as it was freezing the game when Newston levelled up;
[*]Fixed the New Achievement "Bustling With Life", as it was checking the wrong number of characters.
[/list]

[h1]Patch Notes - v0.7.0.4[/h1]

[h2]Fixes[/h2]
[list]
[*]Alchemist’s Combination guide position adjusted as Boss Health Bars were in front of it.
[/list]

[h2]Fixes[/h2]
[list]
[*]Fixed an issue with Trick or Treat System as it was not saving properly between game sessions;
[*]Fixed an issue that made it impossible to skip unlocked characters on gamepad while selecting character presets on the Restaurant and Laboratory;
[*]Fixed an issue with Inner Battery Passive as it would sometimes trigger multiple times while playing with Mausolea;
[*]Fixed a bug where players were not sent to the proper area after leaving the colosseum screen, making it possible to enter areas not yet discovered;
[*]Fixed an issue with Viala's Noxious Miasma that could cause the skill effect to not disappear after the duration was over;
[*]Fixed a bug that would give players certain Achievements on Easy difficulty when it was not supposed to.
[/list]

[h1]Patch Notes - v0.7.0.3[/h1]

[h2]Fixes[/h2]
[list]
[*]Fixed an issue with Mausolea, the Gravekeeper, that could cause the game to freeze and become unresponsive to player input. This seemed to be fix on all our testing so far, but please, notify us on the Bug Reporting Subforum if this issue still happens for you;
[*]Fixed an issue with Agriana, the Farmer, where Removing 4 skills and rerolling would break the 4th slot forever, and further removes could break even more slots. It is now possible to remove the skills without breaking the slots. Players are now able to make a Cropless run with Agriana (for whatever reason);
[*]Fixed an issue on the Colosseum that would give players the achievement for completing areas without even playing those areas;
[*]Fixed a bug with Mausolea that would grant multiple critical chance buffs on the UI from collecting back the Head;
[*]Fixed a bug with Axel, the Lumberjack, where a combo between Chopping Whirlwind and Cumulus Thunder would create a cumulative permanent buff of Movement Speed that got out of hand;
[*]Fixed an issue with 2 of Mausolea's skills, Lone Wolf and Nocturnal Acquaintance, as they were sharing information they were not supposed to and bugging each other in-game.
[/list]

[h1]Patch Notes - v0.6.0.2[/h1]

[h2]New[/h2]
[list]
[*]Added a Loading Screen to certain parts of the game that could take longer to load, so the game doesn't look stuck on a Black Screen.
[/list]

[h2]Adjustments[/h2]
[list]
[*]Axel, the Lumberjack:
[list]
[*]Adjusted Elixir Skills that are chargeable, as they were having an unintended behaviour on Axel due to his own charging mechanic.
[/list][*]Enemies that can heal a % of the max health of another enemy are now capped to a maximum amount of heal, so healing amount can be controlled, specially the Maligsnails at Cavern on higher difficulties. (e.g. Sewvia, the Seamstress, couldn't clear Maligsnails fast enough on Malignous Mode, since her damage outburst is low);
[*]Enemies that can heal can no longer be healed by other sources, so characters with lower damage output can deal with them;
[*]Adjusted Restaurant Lvl 27 description, as it was missing the “+1” for the "Max Health + 1" of the upgrade;
[*]Level Up System can now show Empty Slots if there are no available skills to choose, preventing future errors. This would become an issue if a certain amount of Removes were achievable when the Town Hall gets to further levels as the game progresses.
[/list]

[h2]Bug Fixes[/h2]
[list]
[*]Fixed a bug with some of Theodore’s sound effects;
[*]Fixed an issue with Theodore's Tectonic Artillery's interactions, as it shouldn't be able to break before level 3;
[*]Fixed an issue with Theo's Elastic Experience TM as all levels had an explosion radius bigger than intended;
[*]Fixed End of Stage Chests as some type of flying bosses and the Corrupted Archer could be killed "out of bounds of the stage". End of Stage Chests will now be automatically collected after 5s [b]IF they spawn close or outside the stage limits[/b];
[*]Fixed a bug with the Level Up System as the game was crashing when players had empty skill slots when achieving Masterpiece Levels.
[/list]

[h1]Patch Notes - v0.6.0.1[/h1]

[h2]Bug Fixes[/h2]
[list]
[*]Fixed the error with Rodrigo, the Fisherman, when playing on the Cavern area as he was not able to catch the appropriate fish of the area;
[*]Fixed an issue with multiple of Rodrigo's skills cause by the error above;
[*]Fixed an issue with Sewvia's, the Seamstress, basic attack Yarn Ball not bouncing on enemies anymore;
[*]Fixed an issue with Challenge Stages breaking on Level Up for gamepad controls.
[/list]

[h1]Patch Notes - v0.5.1.2[/h1]

[h2]Adjustments[/h2]
[h3]More content localized to Brazilian Portuguese and Russian.[/h3]

[h2]Adjustments[/h2]
[h3]Living Peak Stage[/h3]
[list]
[*]Reduced the amount of Frogolems in the Stage to speed up the battle towards the boss. Players will reach the boss at a lower level because of the amount of enemies.
[/list]

[h2]Bug Fixes[/h2]
[list]
[*]Fixed an issue with damage increase to enemies caused by debuffs not resetting properly upon enemy death;
[*]Fixed a bug with Chiselo's Self Portrait as it was not causing damage with its sculpt impacts;
[*]Fixed a bug where Agriana would not be able to harvest crops due to empty skill slots on the skill bar;
[*]Fixed an issue with the stage Living Peak where the game would freeze under certain circumstances;
[*]Some damage increase buffs were granting permanent damage bonuses after being removed. The calculation has been changed to avoid these situations;
[*]Fixed an issue with Hanvilton that let him have 0 durability cost in certain situations;
[*]Adjusted the amount of gold needed to perform for the level 29 Fisherman’s Hut upgrade as it was requesting way more gold than intended.
[/list]

[h1]Patch Notes - v0.5.0.3[/h1]

[h2]Adjustments[/h2]
[list]
[*]Adjusted navigation for Beach Stage 7 using the controller
[/list]

[h2]Bug Fixes[/h2]
[list]
[*]Fixed a bug with the Croaking Peak's mud rings as they were not dealing damage as they were supposed to. The attack is supposed to be hazard;
[*]Fixed an issue with Agriana's Chilling Mist and Soothing Sage not working properly with certain Foods, causing the character to be stuck;
[*]Fixed the pre-requisites for Viala's Weaving System skill "Emergency Vial" as it was available without getting the pre-requisite skill. Please, refund skill points to avoid any future issues;
[*]Fixed a bug with Stages that would grant recipes/designs as rewards as they would show these as collectables on a level up after reaching the maximum level;
[*]Fixed an issue where closing a Tutorial panel during a level up would soft lock the game;
[*]Fixed an issue that prevented players to choose extra materials on a level up screen when max level of skills was reached;
[*]Fixed an issue that prevented the controller from opening the Level List of buildings in the Village;
[*]Fixed a visual issue with Stoverick's and Viala's Mail Backgrounds, as they had a mockup Village behind;
[*]Fixed an issue with the Mail System as it would not open properly if a player closed it on a page different from the first one, regardless of the section;
[*]Fixed an issue with the title of the Forest Swamp tutorial inside of the Help Section.
[/list]

[h1]Patch Notes - v0.5.0.2[/h1]

[h2]Adjustments[/h2]
[list]
[*]Reduced the spawn time of the Frogolems on the Living Peak Stage.
[/list]

[h2]Bug Fixes[/h2]
[list]
[*]Fixed an issue with the Alchemist's skill tree where it was grabbing information from the Blacksmith's tree for both the Weaving and Smithing Systems. Please, reset the skill points for Viala to make sure they are working properly;
[*]Fixed an issue with the Alchemist's skill tree on the Smithing System, where certain skills could be activated without their pre-requisites;
[*]Fixed an issue with Deity's Resemblance Marble Level Up descriptions, as they were showing their wood descriptions instead;
[*]Fixed an issue with Deity's Resemblance Marble version not working properly;
[*]Fixed the Completion Jewel display for Viala, the Alchemist, as it wasn't showing when completing stages in any difficulty level;
[*]Fixed an issue with Botanic Marvel as it was not combining with other skills as intended;
[*]Fixed a typo on the Azure Scare Menace name;
[*]Added a failsafe to teleport the Corrupted Archer back to the battlefield if it leaves the boundaries of the Stage. We are still working on improving his collisions with the Stage to avoid this, but for now this will help players that run into this issue so they won't be stuck in the and have to fail the Stage on purpose;
[*]Fixed the display of the Buildings Levels showing greyed text at a few levels under certain circumstances.
[/list]

[h1]Patch Notes - v0.4.1.2[/h1]

[h2]Bug Fixes[/h2]
[list]
[*]Fixed the missing crop (Mint) on the Farming System to upgrade the Farm;
[*]Fixed the missing images of the new Statues unlocked on the Sculptor's Gallery;
[*]Fixed an issue with Hanvilton's Claymore not triggering food effects like the Starlight Delight;
[*]Fixed an issue with Hanvilton's Motivational Boost (upgrade chance buff) not applying correctly;
[*]Fixed a collision with the new Field Event Water Cougar (Aquougar), as it was pushing players away;
[*]Other bug fixes.
[/list]

[h1]Patch Notes - v0.4.1.1[/h1]

[h2]Bug Fixes[/h2]
[list]
[*]Fixed an issue with in-game Text for the New Systems that were already prepared for localization, where the text would be missing for all computers that were not natively set to English;
[*]Fixed an Hanvilton's new skill that would keep the shield after finishing a repair or forge, as it was not supposed to;
[*]Fixed the layer of the Investment System showing the Max Investment in front of the Gamepad Overlay;
[*]Fixed a few texts.
[/list]

[h1]Patch Notes - v0.4.0.7[/h1]

[h2]Bug Fixes[/h2]
[list]
[*]Fixed an issue with Stoverick's Knife Cutting Wave, where it was not causing damage to enemies;
[*]Fixed an issue with Chiselo's Sculpting Impact not causing any damage against enemies;
[*]Fixed the animation of the Holy Pilar spawned on the Wood Deity's Resemblance, as its sprite was missing;
[*]Fixed the animation for the Maligblob Boss (purple exploding bosses), as its sprites were missing.
[/list]

[h1]Patch Notes - v0.4.0.6[/h1]

[h2]Adjustments[/h2]
[list]
[*]Change the materials dropped by Forest Stage EX1 and Forest Stage EX2. They will now drop all of the area’s materials;
[*]Increased the size for the hitbox of Stoverick’s Knife, Axel's Axe, Hanvilton’s Dual Axes and Claymore,  so they hit enemies if they are really close to the player;
[*]Adjusted the SFX of Stoverick's Knife, as it was using the wrong sound;
[*]Other audio changes and adjustments.
[/list]

[h2]Bug Fixes[/h2]
[list]
[*]Fixed an issue with enemies not resetting their stats properly after death. No more Bears with zoomies!
[*]On some instances the Mountain Area would not unlock when defeating the Forest’s Boss. Added a check to help players in this situation unlock the area. Unfortunately the boss will need to be defeated again;
[*]Fixed an issue with the Forest Swamp Tutorial not being saved as seen so it wasn’t showing up on the tutorials screen and was repeating every time players entered Forest Stage 5;
[*]For players who utilized the Restoration Branch to get their progress back some tutorials weren’t appearing again. They should show up properly now.
[/list]

[h1]Patch Notes - v0.4.0.5[/h1]

[h2]Adjustments[/h2]
[h3]Stoverick, the Chef[/h3]
[list]
[*]Revert changes on the collision behaviour of Special Command Serve made on previous patch, as it was creating new issues.
[/list]

[h3]General[/h3]
[list]
[*]Optimizations were made for Damage Numbers and Collectables. We hope these changes increase performance when a great number of enemies are being hit at the same time and dropping collectables.
[/list]

[h2]Bug Fixes[/h2]
[list]
[*]Fixed one of the attacks of the Maligdrum (Forest Boss) as it was not working as intended;
[*]Some field materials were missing from the Merchant after being collected for the first time;
[*]On the last patch the performance boost change we added on a prior update to group experience and gold collectables was not working anymore. Now it is working as intended and should help with performance;
[*]Fixed an issue with Hatchet not collecting drops when Animal Friend Lv 3 was obtained. That caused huge FPS drops as he could be carrying a very big amount of drops when entering the screen;
[*]Fixed an issue with Dual Axes Stress Test interacting with the Mystic Forge, which left Hanvilton stuck forever. The skill will not interact with the Mystic Forge anymore;
[*]Fixed the News unlocked when defeating the Azure Menace Boss Challenge that was missing;
[*]Fixed an issue with the Red Maligoon Boss (enemy that slams its head on the floor) as some sprites were missing when performing its attack;
[*]Fixed an issue with the Dark Teal Maligoon Elites (enemy that slams its head on the floor) as it would attack once and stop working for the remainder of the run;
[*]The music was not stopping when defeating main Bosses of the area. This has now been fixed and the music will stop when the boss is defeated;
[*]Fixed a few visual errors in the Village of texts in front of overlays (gamepad only);
[*]Fixed a few visuals showing the wrong button in the Village and Menus (gamepad only).
[/list]


[h1]Sneak Peek of the new Systems[/h1]
We are currently developing 2 new Systems for the game that will be introduced in the Mountain area with more Stages. We will use Spoiler tags on this information for players that still want to keep the surprise when unlocking them.

[spoiler]The Systems for the Forge and the Tailor Shop will bring more aspects for players to customize their experience further. These will consist on specific passive skills that will improve weapons and defensive status, allowing players to take their favourite characters to the next level![/spoiler]

There's also a mockup of what the System will look like.
[spoiler]
[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/42919706/19487e924e5556176f6274fd9c3424c18fbd9050.png[/img][/spoiler]

[h1]Patch Notes - v0.4.0.1[/h1]

We are fixing issues created with the collisions of the game created while we were trying to make some improvements to performance. Some interactions between colliders were missing due to these latest changes and a few instances were missing.
Make sure to update the game to this version to fix these latest issues.

[h2]Bug Fixes[/h2]
[list]
[*]Fixed an issue where characters could not save Axel, the Lumberjack, at the end of the Stage;
[*]Fixed an issue with Collector's Idol and its collision as it was not collecting anything;
[*]Fixed an issue with Heroic Technic using the Axe, as the skill was not firing the projectiles as it was supposed to;
[*]Adjusted the navigation of the Mountain Stage 2A on the area selection screen.
[/list]

[h1]Patch Notes - v0.2.3.2[/h1]

[h2]Adjustments to Easy Mode[/h2]
[list]
[*]Bosses now drop their material on Easy Mode, so players can progress with the boss material.
[/list]

[h2]Bug Fixes[/h2]
[list]
[*]Fixed a bug where the Special Stage that drops the Ruby MapleLeaf would not grant the material when playing on Easy Mode;
[*]Added a fix to grant the Ruby MapleLeaf to players that have already cleared the Special Stage and haven't been granted the Ruby Leaf because of the Easy Mode;
[*]Fixed a bug with the red Elite ranged enemy, when it died but stayed on the field with its collisions;
[*]Fixed a bug where the Trader would never spawn in the village;
[*]Fixed the description for some skills.
[/list]

[h1]Patch Notes - v0.2.2[/h1]

[h2]New Features[/h2]
[h3]Accessibility[/h3]
[list]
[*]Added a setting to adjust the opacity of Player Skills;
[*]Added a setting to adjust the opacity of Player Objects, such as statues, crops, ovens, etc;
[*]Added a setting to adjust the opacity of Particles;
[*]Added a setting to display a small Dodge Icon UI close to the Player character.
[/list]
[h3]Cast Settings[/h3]
Manual and Auto cast settings will now be saved per character, so you can have different settings depending on the playstyle prefer on each of the characters in the roster.

[h2]Adjustments[/h2]
[h3]Agriana, the Farmer[/h3]
[list]
[*]Fully Grown Crops won't have their indicator anymore, to reduce excess information on screen;
[*]Adjusted the Farming radius to collect Crops, to avoid having to retreat and go back to the Crop;
[*]Corntling Gun Buffs and Changes:[list]
[*]Lvl 2 - Added an increase firing rate of 30%;
[*]Lvl 4 - Added an increase in damage of 50% per shot;
[*]Lvl 5 - Removed the effect that doubled the amount of ammo. Added an increase firing rate of 30% and an increase in movement speed while firing by 20%.
[/list]
[*]Broccammer Buffs and Changes:[list]
[*]Lvl 2 - Increased the size of the attack by 50%;
[*]Lvl 4 - Increased the size of the attack by 50%;
[*]Lvl 5 - Removed the effect that doubled the amount of uses for the weapon. Added an effect that causes 2 extra impacts around you in the 4 diagonal directions every time the Broccammer is smashed on the ground.
[/list]
[*]Carrodrill Buffs and Changes:[list]
[*]Lvl 2 - Added an increase on critical hit chance of 15%;
[*]Lvl 3 - Added an increase on critical hit chance of 15%;
[*]Lvl 5 - Removed the effect that doubled the amount of uses for the weapon. Added an effect that fires a Drill in the direction you dash, dealing damage to all enemies in its path.
[/list]
[*]Chilling Mint Nerf:[list]
[*]Increased the cooldown of the Skill required to plant a Mint Seed;
[*]Increased the interval between attacks dealt by the Chilling Mint.
[/list]
[*]Earthy Thyme Nerf and Fix:[list]
[*]Decreased the size of the Earth Spikes on higher levels;
[*]Fixed the Earth Spike circles on higher levels, that were spawning the wrong combination.
[/list]
[*]Soothing Sage Nerf:[list]
[*]Increased the cooldown of the Skill required to plant a Sage Seed;
[*]Decreased the size of Soothing Sage attacks on all levels.
[/list][/list]
[h3]Axel, the Lumberjack[/h3]
[list]
[*]Axel can now use Lumber Skills and Hatchet’s skills while charging his own skills;
[*]Auto charged skills will not cancel skills that are being charged manually anymore;
[*]Axel can now move while charging his skills. Movement speed will be reduced by 60% when charging a skill. Skills will charge faster when the character is NOT moving;
[*]Chopping Whirlwind will now display the correct colour for the Attack Swipe.
[/list]

[h2]Bug Fixes[/h2]
[list]
[*]Fixed the layering issue with Agriana's Till Soil skill, where the Soil would have priority over attack indicators. Attack Indicators will have priority over the Soil now;
[*]Fixed an issue with the Merchant’s UI when navigation through empty slots;
[*]Fixed the material for the Forge that was requesting 710 of the wrong material.
[/list]

[h1]Patch Notes - v0.2.1.1[/h1]

[h2]Bug Fixes[/h2]
[list]
[*]Fixed the Bank UI buttons and Merchant UI buttons that showed the wrong controller inputs;
[*]Fixed the Bank UI buttons that were increasing the amount of Gold in the wrong buttons;
[*]Fixed a visual bug with the Back Button, showing only the Playstation Circle regardless of the control scheme;
[*]Fixed a bug where exiting the same stage through the same Exit in a row without unlocking all the stages would freeze the game;
[*]Other bug fixes.
[/list]

[h1]Patch Notes - Version 0.1.3.2[/h1]

[h2]Bug Fixes[/h2]
[h3]General[/h3]
[list]
[*]Reverted the visual layer of the Mushrooms in the Forest, to have proper visibility over scenario assets;
[*]Fixed a bug where enemies would respawn with previously afflicted debuffs (like bleeding);
[*]Fixed an issue with the boss stage spawning more monsters than required;
[*]Added missing icons for Numpad Numbers when rebinding keyboard controls;
[*]Other bug fixes.
[/list]

[h2]Patch Notes[/h2]

[h3]General Gameplay[/h3]
[list]
[*]Tooltips, auto setup and swapping skills are available in the level up UI;
[*]Added a menu option to change the direction of dodge between movement and target.
[/list]

Bug Fixes
[list]
[*]Fixed a bug where pulling skills such as Flambé and Moon's Allure would work on the Great Maligtopus. They don't pull the boss anymore;
[*]Fixed a bug where the Tentacles of the Great Maligtopus were being pulled by pulling skills such as Flambé and Moon's Allure;
[*]Fixed a bug with rebinding movement controls on keyboard;
[*]Fixed Sewing Journey, where Sewvia would get stuck on trees or area boundaries;
[*]Fixed Font settings to show some characters properly, such as the É on Flambé;
[*]Other bug fixes.
[/list]
